{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54818","headline":"兵要望江南 占地第十五（二十一首） 十八 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占地第十五（二十一首） 十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城营内，地忽现（辛本、川本、京本作「陷」）崩摧。\n祸结兵连缘此兆，移营修义灭（京本作「速修仁义免」）凶灾，不信将身推（京本作「危」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54818.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54818","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}